    <h1>Product Hierarchy Updates D365</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"ProductHierarchyUpdatesD365-FSP-Notes">FSP - Notes</h1>
<p>Black is "level 2.00 "Solution Category"</p>
<p>Green is "level 3.00 "Solution"</p>
<p>Cases choose the "Solution" that has =E2=80=9CShow In Portal Field =3D Y=
es=E2=80=9D (Cases in D365 are set to associated Software Product Master")<=
/p>
<h1 id=3D"ProductHierarchyUpdatesD365-FAM,0=3DUnit">FAM, 0 =3D Unit</h1>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 30.0px;">Cyber<br>
Tech<br>
Corporate (BSS-23284 to update Non-Specific to Corporate)</p>
