<h1 id=3D"ProductHierarchyUpdatesD365-F2=3DSolutionCategory">F2 =3D Solutio=
n Category</h1>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Brand Level Changes (Level 2.00) =3D BSS-23284 Update Automation to RPA+=
</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>=E2=80=9CBeyond Security=E2=80=9D F2BEYONDSECURITY &amp; =E2=80=9CDigita=
l Defense=E2=80=9D F2DIGITALDEFENSE Move these and all associated Products =
to "Defensive Security" F1DIGITALRISKPROTECT.</p></li>
<li>
<p>BoKS F2BOKS, Capacity Management F2CAPACITYMANAGEMENT, Core IGA F2COREIG=
A, InterMapper F2INTERMAPPER, Move to RPA+ =E2=80=9CF1AUTOMATION</p></li>
</ol></li>
</ol>
<p></p>
<p></p>
